    "theory": "<h3>Сочетания гласных</h3>\n<table><tr><th>Буквы</th><th>Звук</th><th>Примеры</th></tr>\n<tr><td>ee, ea</td><td>i</td><td>see, meet, tea, eat (но bread [ɛ], great [eɪ])</td></tr>\n<tr><td>oo</td><td>u / ʊ</td><td>food, moon / book, good, look</td></tr>\n<tr><td>ou</td><td>aʊ</td><td>house, out, mouth</td></tr>\n<tr><td>ow</td><td>aʊ / oʊ</td><td>now, how / snow, know</td></tr>\n<tr><td>ai, ay</td><td>eɪ</td><td>rain, wait / day, play</td></tr>\n<tr><td>igh</td><td>aɪ</td><td>night, light, high</td></tr></table>\n<h3>Гласные + r</h3>\n<table><tr><th>Буквы</th><th>Звук</th><th>Примеры</th></tr>\n<tr><td>ar</td><td>ɑr</td><td>car, park, start</td></tr>\n<tr><td>or</td><td>ɔr</td><td>for, short, morning</td></tr>\n<tr><td>er, ir, ur</td><td>ɜr</td><td>her, first, turn, work</td></tr>\n<tr><td>air, are</td><td>ɛr</td><td>chair, hair, care</td></tr>\n<tr><td>eer, ear</td><td>ɪr</td><td>beer, near, hear</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"tip\">her, bird, word, turn — все звучат одинаково [ɜr]: язык в центре рта, губы нейтральные. Не говорите «бёрд» с русским «ё».</div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><b>Let's meet at the park.</b><i>Давай встретимся в парке.</i></div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><b>It's raining today.</b><i>Сегодня идёт дождь.</i></div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><b>Good night, see you tomorrow.</b><i>Спокойной ночи, до завтра.</i></div>",
